  "title": "Present Simple: -s, -es, -ies",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "После s, sh, ch, x, o добавляется **-es**: watch → watch**es**, go → go**es**, do → do**es**. Согласная + y → **-ies**: study → stud**ies**. Гласная + y — просто -s: play → play**s**."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Глагол",
        "he / she / it"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "work",
            "works"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "watch",
            "watches"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "go",
            "goes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "study",
            "studies"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "play",
            "plays"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "have",
            "has"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "**Have** неправильный: he **has**, а не haves."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "es": "She watches TV in the evening.",
      "ru": "Вечером она смотрит телевизор."
    },
    {
      "es": "He goes to the gym.",
